WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,840
The system produced fifty simple guide leaflets and placed them in my office.

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,680
Does the system have exclusive transportation for the hotel?

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,240
Unlockable takeaway electric vehicle

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,040
How many points are needed to unlock it?

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,960
To unlock in advance, you need to pay 100 points.

6
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:19,460
Good merit pay

7
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,260
Little boss, this electric car looks brand new.

8
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:24,020
The battery can still be used after being stored for such a long time

9
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:30,190
It can be used. Just charge it.

10
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:33,510
Bear, move a microwave oven to the shelf in the hall

11
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:41,190
You seem to have someone here

12
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:43,590
Hello guest, do you need accommodation?
